  "description": "A Serilog sink for SharpCoreDB - a lightweight, encrypted, file-based database. Features efficient batch logging with AES-256-GCM encryption, AppendOnly storage engine for maximum write speed, and full async support. Compatible with SharpCoreDB 1.7.1+.",
